  ## parrallel builds
  ## Jenkins Pipeline Parallel build & test
  we will learn how run build test at the same time

  pipiline {

    agent any
    stages{
        stage ('Patallel tasks'){
            parallel {
                stage('Build'){
                    steps{
                        sh 'mvn clean compile'
                    }
                }
                stage ('test'){
                        steps{
                            sh "mvn test"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
  

  ## Gitlab CI parallel jobs
  we will learn how to run parallel jobs in gitlab ci

  stage:
  - build-test

  maven-build:
  stage:build-test
  image:mavne:3.8.1-jdk-17
  script:
  - git clone https://github.com/Pathnex/sample-java-app.git
  - cd sample-java-app
  - mvn clean compile
  parallel:1

  maven-test:
  stage:build-test
  image:maven:3.8.1-jdk-17
  script:
  - cd sample-java-app
  - mvn test
  parallel:1
